name: herdr
description: "Inspect and control Herdr panes, tabs, workspaces, commands, and coding agents. Use only when user explicitly mentions Herdr or requests Herdr control. Support managed panes with HERDR_ENV=1 and authorized Gateway SSH without HERDR_ENV. Do not invoke merely for background terminals, delegation, or parallel work."
